msgstr "このメッセージはアクティブなチャンネルで表示されました"

#. Tooltip of the small mode-prefix marker (a character such as + or @) shown before messages that the server delivered only to the part of the channel holding that status. {mode} is the mode character itself, inserted verbatim.
#: client/components/StatusmsgMarker.vue:4
msgctxt "message.statusmsg"
msgid "This message was only shown to users with {mode} mode"
msgstr "このメッセージは{mode}モードを持つユーザーのみに表示されました"

